---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于星程" description="了解星程计划的学习理念、实践方式与成员资料入口。">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">ABOUT XINGCHENG</span><h1>关于星程</h1><p>保持好奇，敢于动手，认真复盘，在真实任务中积累能力。</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad"><div class="container about-grid"><div><span class="section-kicker">项目介绍</span><h2>让学习与实践相互照亮</h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p>星程计划是面向本科生的科研训练与成长项目，围绕招新、学习路线、暑假集训、项目实践、阶段汇报和团队交流持续建设。</p><p>我们希望同学们在自主学习和真实任务中，逐步完成从理解知识、动手验证，到找到个人探索方向的过程。</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="about-values section-pad"><div class="container value-grid"><div><span>01 / 学习</span><h3>建立框架</h3><p>从 Python 到大模型和 Agent，用阶段路线梳理核心概念。</p></div><div><span>02 / 实践</span><h3>动手验证</h3><p>通过作业、项目与打榜，把想法放到真实问题中检验。</p></div><div><span>03 / 交流</span><h3>共同成长</h3><p>在导师交流、活动分享与阶段复盘中不断修正方向。</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad community-photos"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">实践与交流</span><h2>把探索带到现场</h2></div><p>项目分享、技术公益与面对面的交流。</p></div><div class="community-grid"><figure><img src="/images/technical-public-welfare/presentation.png" alt="技术公益活动现场，同学手持话筒进行项目汇报" loading="lazy" width="720" height="480" /><figcaption>项目汇报</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/technical-public-welfare/technical-award.png" alt="两位同学在活动现场展示 CCF 技术公益马拉松最佳技术奖展板" loading="lazy" width="720" height="480" /><figcaption>获奖时刻</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/technical-public-welfare/audience.png" alt="活动现场，老师在台下聆听分享" loading="lazy" width="720" height="480" /><figcaption>现场交流</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">团队生活</span><h2>学习之外，也有这些瞬间</h2></div></div><div class="community-grid team-life-grid"><figure><img src="/images/team-life/xingcheng-banner.png" alt="同学在办公室手持写有科海星程的红色横幅" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>科海星程</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/team-life/stage-performance.png" alt="两位同学在舞台话筒前表演交流" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>舞台时刻</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad"><div class="container member-banner"><div><span class="section-kicker">成员入口</span><h2>继续使用项目资料库</h2><p>内部资料保存在原有 GitHub 仓库。成员登录并拥有访问权限后，可查看完整材料与作业归档。</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="https://github.com/xingcheng-plan/xingcheng-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">进入资料库（需权限）↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
